{l s='This is the average number of orders placed by inactive customers.' mod='opartstat'}<br />
{l s='We use inactive customers in order to have the most realistic data possible.' mod='opartstat'}<br />
{l s='If we used active customers, there would be a significant proportion of new customers who have only placed one order because they have only known your site for a few days or weeks.' mod='opartstat'}<br />
{l s='By using inactive customers, we ensure that the number of orders obtained is representative of customer activity throughout their entire relationship with your site.' mod='opartstat'}<br />
{l s='You can define the number of days before a customer becomes inactive in the module configuration under the "General Settings" section.' mod='opartstat'}<br />
{l s='This data does not depend on the selected period.' mod='opartstat'}